# Icon catalog NOTICE

`apps/canvas/src/icons/catalog.generated.json` is generated at build time by
`scripts/gen-icon-catalog.mjs` from the following icon families, distributed via
the `react-icons` package. The runtime ships only the generated SVG data; the
`react-icons` package itself is a devDependency and is **not** bundled.

| Library | react-icons pack | License |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Lucide | `react-icons/lu` | ISC |
| Tabler Icons | `react-icons/tb` | MIT |
| Heroicons | `react-icons/hi2` | MIT |
| Bootstrap Icons | `react-icons/bi` | MIT |
| Font Awesome Free | `react-icons/fa6` | CC BY 4.0 (icons) / OFL-1.1 (fonts) |
| Material Icons | `react-icons/md` | Apache-2.0 |

react-icons itself: MIT — https://github.com/react-icons/react-icons

