Each generated entry carries a `license` field. Attribution for Font Awesome Free
is required under CC BY 4.0; keep this NOTICE with any redistribution of
`catalog.generated.json`.

Arbitrary official SVG icons can be imported with `import_asset({url,type:"svg"})`;
their license is the user's responsibility (Canvas only records provenance).
